  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a0101010101040008000101010101001, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  badgeSpanish: NIVEL 1 - PRIMEROS BOTES
  badgeEnglish: LEVEL 1 - FIRST BINS
  titleSpanish: "\xA1Conoce los primeros 3 basureros!"
  titleEnglish: Meet the first 3 recycling bins!
  descriptionSpanish: "En este nivel aprender\xE1s a diferenciar los primeros 3 colores:
    VERDE (Org\xE1nico, como c\xE1scaras de fruta), AZUL (Inorg\xE1nico reciclable)
    y GRIS (Basura normal sin l\xEDquidos)."
  descriptionEnglish: 'In this level you will learn the first 3 bin colors: GREEN
    (Organic food scraps), BLUE (Recyclable inorganic), and GREY (General dry waste).'
  stepsSpanish: "1. Observa la c\xE1scara de pl\xE1tano sobre la mesa.\n2. T\xF3mala
    con el bot\xF3n de agarre (Grip) y ll\xE9vala al Bote VERDE (Org\xE1nico).\n3.
    \xA1Cuidado! Si te equivocas de bote, el nivel se reiniciar\xE1."
  stepsEnglish: '1. Look at the banana peel on the table.

    2. Grab it with the
    grip button and drop it into the GREEN (Organic) bin.

    3. Careful! If you
    make a mistake, the level will restart.'
  buttonSpanish: Aceptar
  buttonEnglish: OK
  badgeText: {fileID: 2855894387845483845}
  titleText: {fileID: 1610025614831611090}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 1409490411124961454}
